### Security Tests - Nginx Reverse Proxy Routes
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000/api (routes through Nginx to API Gateway)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### These tests focus on security aspects and attack scenarios
### All tests should fail gracefully without exposing sensitive information

### AUTHENTICATION SECURITY TESTS

### 1. SQL Injection Attempts in Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com'; DROP TABLE users; --",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 2. NoSQL Injection Attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": {"$ne": null},
  "password": {"$ne": null}
}

### 3. XSS in Registration Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "email": "xss@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "nom": "<script>alert('XSS')</script>",
  "prenom": "<img src=x onerror=alert('XSS')>",
  "role": "etudiant"
}

### 4. Command Injection in Email Field
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com; cat /etc/passwd",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 5. LDAP Injection
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com)(|(password=*))",
  "password": "anything"
}

### 6. Path Traversal in Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "../../../etc/passwd",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 7. Buffer Overflow Attempt (Very Long Password)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "A" * 10000
}

### 8. Unicode/UTF-8 Attacks
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com\u0000.evil.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### TOKEN SECURITY TESTS

### 9. JWT Token Manipulation - Invalid Signature
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwibmFtZSI6IkpvaG4gRG9lIiwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyfQ.SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36POk6yJV_adQssw5c

### 10. JWT Token with Modified Claims
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGluY3ViYXRpLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImV4cCI6OTk5OTk5OTk5OX0.modified_signature

### 11. Empty JWT Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer

### 12. Malformed JWT Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer not.a.jwt.token

### 13. JWT with "none" Algorithm
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJub25lIiwidHlwIjoiSldUIn0.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGluY3ViYXRpLmNvbSIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiJ9.

### 14. Expired Token (Use an actually expired token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_EXPIRED_TOKEN_HERE

### HTTP HEADER ATTACKS

### 15. Host Header Injection
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Host: evil.com

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 16. X-Forwarded-For Spoofing
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 17. User-Agent Header Injection
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: <script>alert('XSS')</script>

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 18. HTTP Method Override
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
X-HTTP-Method-Override: POST
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### FILE UPLOAD SECURITY TESTS

### 19. Upload Executable File
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Malicious Executable
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="malicious.exe"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

MZ\x90\x00\x03\x00\x00\x00
------SecurityTest--

### 20. Upload PHP Shell
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

PHP Shell
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="shell.php"
Content-Type: application/pdf

<?php system($_GET['cmd']); ?>
------SecurityTest--

### 21. Upload with Path Traversal Filename
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Path Traversal Test
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="../../../etc/passwd"
Content-Type: application/pdf

Test content
------SecurityTest--

### 22. Upload with Null Byte in Filename
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Null Byte Test
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.pdf%00.php"
Content-Type: application/pdf

Test content
------SecurityTest--

### 23. Upload Polyglot File (PDF + JS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Polyglot File
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="polyglot.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4<script>alert('XSS')</script>
1 0 obj<</Type/Catalog/Pages 2 0 R>>endobj
2 0 obj<</Type/Pages/Kids[3 0 R]/Count 1>>endobj
3 0 obj<</Type/Page/Parent 2 0 R/MediaBox[0 0 612 792]>>endobj
xref
0 4
trailer<</Size 4/Root 1 0 R>>
startxref
200
%%EOF
------SecurityTest--

### AUTHORIZATION BYPASS ATTEMPTS

### 24. Parameter Pollution
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications/query?role=admin&role=student
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

### 25. Case Sensitivity Bypass
POST {{baseUrl}}/AUTH/LOGIN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 26. HTTP Verb Tampering
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 27. Authorization Header Manipulation
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN
Authorization: Bearer ADMIN_TOKEN

