### INFORMATION DISCLOSURE TESTS

### 33. Request Non-existent Endpoint for Error Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/secret-endpoint

### 34. SQL Error Induction
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com'",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 35. Request Server Info Headers
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/auth/login

### 36. Try to Access Internal Endpoints
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/health

### 37. Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF) Attempt
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----SecurityTest
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_STUDENT_TOKEN

------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="application_id"

YOUR_APPLICATION_ID
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

SSRF Test
------SecurityTest
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

HTTP request to internal service
------SecurityTest--

### CONTENT-TYPE ATTACKS

### 38. Content-Type Confusion
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: text/plain

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 39. JSON in XML Content-Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/xml

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 40. Binary Content as JSON
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

\x00\x01\x02\x03\x04\x05

### CORS AND ORIGIN ATTACKS

### 41. Cross-Origin Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: https://evil.com

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### 42. Null Origin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: null

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456"
}

### LARGE PAYLOAD ATTACKS

### 43. Large JSON Payload (DoS Attempt)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "A" * 1000000
}

### 44. Deeply Nested JSON (JSON Bomb)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@incubati.com",
  "password": "admin123456",
  "nested": {"a": {"b": {"c": {"d": {"e": {"f": {"g": {"h": {"i": {"j": "deep"}}}}}}}}}}
}

### DIRECT ACCESS ATTEMPTS

### 45. Try to Access MinIO Directly (Should be blocked)
GET http://localhost:5000/minio

### 46. Try to Access Application Service Directly (Should be blocked)  
GET http://localhost:5000/app-service

### 47. Try to Access Database Directly (Should be blocked)
GET http://localhost:5000/db

### 48. Nginx Config Exposure Attempt
GET http://localhost:5000/nginx.conf

### 49. Docker Secrets Exposure Attempt
GET http://localhost:5000/.env

### 50. Git Repository Exposure Attempt
GET http://localhost:5000/.git/config
